       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INLINELOOPS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ROW-NUM PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       01 COL-NUM PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       01 CELL    PIC Z9.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING ROW-NUM FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL ROW-NUM > 3
               PERFORM VARYING COL-NUM FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL COL-NUM > 3
                   COMPUTE CELL = ROW-NUM * COL-NUM
                   DISPLAY CELL " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               END-PERFORM
               DISPLAY " "
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
